              "startLine1based": 1349,
              "endLine1based": 1382,
              "text": "def(\n    \"삼각비\",\n    \"12\",\n    \"사분원을 이용하여 삼각비의 값 구하기\",\n    SEC.값,\n    \"응용\",\n    (rng) => {\n      const ang = intBetween(rng, 25, 65);\n      const rad = ang * DEG;\n      const s100 = Math.round(Math.sin(rad) * 100);\n      const c100 = Math.round(Math.cos(rad) * 100);\n      const t100 = Math.round(Math.tan(rad) * 100);\n      const mode = intBetween(rng, 0, 4);\n      const parts = [[s100], [c100], [t100], [s100, c100], [c100, t100]][mode]!;\n      const x100 = parts.reduce((u, v) => u + v, 0);\n      const asked = [\n        `\\\\sin ${ang}^\\\\circ`,\n        `\\\\cos ${ang}^\\\\circ`,\n        `\\\\tan ${ang}^\\\\circ`,\n        `\\\\sin ${ang}^\\\\circ+\\\\cos ${ang}^\\\\circ`,\n        `\\\\cos ${ang}^\\\\circ+\\\\tan ${ang}^\\\\circ`,\n      ][mode]!;\n      const two = (v: number): string => (v / 100).toFixed(2);\n      return {\n        content: `반지름의 길이가 $1$인 사분원에서 $\\\\angle AOB=${ang}^\\\\circ$이다. 점 $B$에서 $\\\\overline{OA}$에 내린 수선의 발을 $H$라 하고, 점 $A$를 지나고 $\\\\overline{OA}$에 수직인 직선이 $\\\\overrightarrow{OB}$와 만나는 점을 $T$라 하자. $\\\\overline{BH}=${two(s100)}$, $\\\\overline{OH}=${two(c100)}$, $\\\\overline{AT}=${two(t100)}$일 때, $${asked}$의 값을 구하시오.`,\n        answer: `$${two(x100)}$`,\n        solution: `$\\\\overline{OB}=\\\\overline{OA}=1$이므로 $\\\\sin ${ang}^\\\\circ=\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{BH}}{\\\\overline{OB}}=\\\\overline{BH}$, $\\\\cos ${ang}^\\\\circ=\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{OH}}{\\\\overline{OB}}=\\\\overline{OH}$, $\\\\tan ${ang}^\\\\circ=\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{AT}}{\\\\overline{OA}}=\\\\overline{AT}$이다.\\n따라서 $${asked}=${two(x100)}$이다.`,\n        facts: { ang, s100, c100, t100, mode, x100 },\n        figureSpec: figQuadrant({ ang }),\n      };\n    },\n  ),\n\n  "
            }
          }
